<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="&quot;ALEX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A leader of a team attempting first contact with an unknown intelligence, acknowledging the significance of their task."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alex is a character who experiences frustration and is observant of the dynamics among other characters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alex is a leader at Lunch Positive, indicating their role within the organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alex is a member of an organization that communicates with an unknown intelligence, showing a mix of awe and anxiety."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alex is a person who works at The Clock Tower Sanctuary and provides support to young people experiencing homelessness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alex is the leader of a team attempting first contact with an unknown intelligence, acknowledging the significance of their task."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alex is the leader of a team working on communicating with an unknown intelligence, showing a mix of awe and anxiety."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alex is the leader of the team attempting first contact with an unknown intelligence, acknowledging the significance of their task."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alex's team is a group working on a mission, indicating a shift in their role."</data>
