  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Brighton &amp; Hove Food Partnership is a non-profit organization working towards a healthy, sustainable, fair food system for Brighton and Hove."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brighton &amp; Hove Food Partnership is a not-for-profit organization that provides various food projects and initiatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brighton &amp; Hove Food Partnership is a relevant entity for supporting Moulsecoomb Forest Garden and Wildlife Project's work."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brighton &amp; Hove Food Partnership is an organization that coordinates efforts to address food poverty and provides support to residents with the costs of essentials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brighton &amp; Hove Food Partnership is an organization that partners with YMCA YAC to support the Food Market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brighton &amp; Hove Food Partnership runs the Community Kitchen and offers various programs to support individuals in need."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brighton and Hove Food Partnership is a partner in the Ready Healthy Eat project."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Brighton &amp; Hove Food Partnership runs therapeutic gardening activities in a range of spaces, including various outdoor locations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Brighton and Hove Food Partnership – A non-profit which helps people learn to cook, eat healthily and to waste less food."</data>
